<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on June 13.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on June 13.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 June 13		June 12</p>
<p>Fed acct			 5.735		  4.280</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	   8.921		  7.875</p>
<p>Cash balance		  14.656		 12.155</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,267.742	     5,266.398</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $519 million were issued and $52 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
